collection of useless artifacts short due to that.

The major difference between that aspect of Angband and my idea is
that you can still carry around as much stuff as you want.  You just
have to find it after you enter Gehennom.  Essentially, Gehennom is
the start of a new equipment-finding mission.  You have a few
essentials, but you have to assemble much of your stuff, only this
time under more difficult conditions.  However, once you have it, you
don't lose it.  You can even take it in and out of Gehennom as many
times as you like.

So yes, I now see the surface similarity, but it wouldn't play the
same at all.

